SOAPBOX: As I am currently travelling with my wife through ZL with a RV, I
SOAPBOX: was not able to participate in the CQWW CW this year. However, I
SOAPBOX: could not resist to log in remotely to my station close to Munich
SOAPBOX: while waiting for the ferry to the South Island in Wellington. Highlight
SOAPBOX: was working KH6 on 40m from DL remotely in a RV in Wellington, ZL
SOAPBOX: with cellular internet. Cool, isn t it. Latency is always a
SOAPBOX: challenge but it worked out! Thanks for the organisation and see
SOAPBOX: you next year. 73, Michael, DF2RQ
